@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title SEQ-002 — Foreground routing and stale results
footer APPROVED D-016 DEC-076 | UC-006

actor Tourist
participant UI
participant "Browser GPS" as GPS
participant "Graph loader" as Data
participant "A* Web Worker" as Engine
Tourist -> UI: Start walking to one POI
UI -> GPS: Subscribe foreground fixes
GPS --> UI: Fix + accuracy / unavailable
alt Valid fix and entrance
 UI -> Data: Obtain compatible graph snapshot
 Data --> UI: Graph / unavailable
 alt Graph available
  UI -> Engine: LOAD_GRAPH then CALCULATE_ROUTE(requestId)
  Engine -> Engine: Snap, directed path, instructions
  Engine --> UI: Result / NO_ROUTE / SNAP_NOT_FOUND
  UI -> UI: Accept current request + destination + version only
 else Missing graph
  UI -> UI: Data unavailable + Retry
 end
else GPS uncertain / unavailable
 UI -> UI: Preserve route; mark position unavailable
end
loop Foreground valid fixes
 GPS --> UI: New fix
 UI -> UI: Arrival / off-route counters / cooldown
 opt Recalculation needed
  UI -> Engine: Current recalculation only
  Engine --> UI: Versioned result
 end
end
opt Stop / destination changed / synced deletion
 UI -> Engine: Terminate current worker if calculation active
 UI -> UI: Invalidate request; stop old navigation
end

@enduml
